-- The intermediate value theorem in the decreasing direction, a zero
-- between values of opposite signs, and the constancy of the sign of a
-- continuous function on an interval or a ray where it has no zero.
-- Part of the CAD blueprint.
-- Planned home: Real/Analysis/IntermediateValue.
